      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It sounds incredibly painful to feel that your attempt to do the right thing resulted in such devastating consequences. Please know that your experience does not define your worth as a person, even if the current environment feels utterly corrupt. You don't have to keep fighting this battle alone; reaching out to a professional counselor or support group can provide a vital space for you to process this immense loss. There are paths forward, even when the system feels overwhelmingly stacked against you.",
