      "content": "It sounds like the sheer scale of systemic injustice makes small comforts feel trivial and inadequate against the magnitude of your pain. When the external world feels this hostile, shifting focus to internal survival isn't about fixing the world; it's about protecting the part of you that still exists. Please, if the thought of letting go is becoming a significant focus, know that there is immediate help available right now. You can connect with trained listeners by calling or texting 988 in the US and Canada, or similar crisis lines globally.",
